<title>THAILAND: Thai Aug trade deficit widens to 36.8 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Aug trade deficit widens to 36.8 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that Thailand's August trade deficit widened to 36.8 billion baht from a revised 35.5 billion in July and against 36.2 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE     Aug 96    July 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     117.7	110.8	   121.7</p>
<p>	  Imports	     154.5	146.3	   157.9</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -36.8	-35.5	   -36.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-252-9950</p>
</text>
